    {
      "id": "claim_f9cf854e458c4cc2bb2d54706bef916f",
      "statement": "Known limitations of the EVE approach: parallel shocks only, static balance sheet, constant betas, and (per Pillar 3) no capture of basis risk, mortgage prepayment optionality beyond the static profile, or deposit-beta convexity at low rates; the compensating control is a quarterly dynamic balance-sheet simulation in the ALM engine reviewed by ALCO.",
